From 0c96d600f306b89a6ad3f6fc2453f8122ac81e57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:14:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LICENSES/README.md: the files of the output handover are
 GPL-2.0-or-later

The note on the licences of the ENABLE_DVBRIDGE build named
DVBridgeState.cpp and DVBridgeState.h as GPL-3.0-or-later. Those files
are gone: the output that native output takes is held by
OutputHandover.cpp and .h, OutputState.h, LibdrmKms.h and
DetectedProperty.h, written from the KMS interface and GPL-2.0-or-later,
so no file that this build adds to Kodi is GPL-3.0-or-later. The note
now says so, names the two pages of the player information that are made
from Estuary and keep its GPL-2.0-only, and says why the program as
LibreELEC builds it is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (the Samba
client and FFmpeg built under version 3 of the GPL), which is what the
text of that licence beside it is for.
---
 LICENSES/README.md | 16 +++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/LICENSES/README.md b/LICENSES/README.md
index 8035c05..2582394 100644
--- a/LICENSES/README.md
+++ b/LICENSES/README.md
@@ -5,13 +5,15 @@ Kodi is provided under the terms of the GNU General Public License v2.0 or later
 
 The `ENABLE_DVBRIDGE` build, the only one that LibreELEC Hades makes, adds the
 DVBridge helpers of `tools/dvbridge` and of `xbmc`. They are GPL-2.0-or-later,
-except `xbmc/windowing/gbm/drm/DVBridgeState.cpp` and `DVBridgeState.h`, whose
-SPDX line says GPL-3.0-or-later: the build that includes them is distributed
-under GPL-3.0-or-later; see **[LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later](GPL-3.0-or-later)**.
-Existing files retain their original notices. With the option off, those two
-files are not compiled, and no file that is compiled includes their header: it
-is included under `HAVE_DVBRIDGE`, or by files that are compiled only with the
-option. A build with the option off is not tested.
+as is the rest of the code that LibreELEC Hades adds to Kodi. The pages of its
+player information for other skins (`system/hades/HadesIncludes.xml` and
+`DialogHadesPlayerInfo.xml`) are made from the files of Estuary and keep their
+licence, GPL-2.0-only. Existing files retain their original notices.
+
+As LibreELEC builds it, the program is linked with the Samba client
+(GPL-3.0-or-later) and with FFmpeg built under version 3 of the GPL, so the
+Kodi of LibreELEC Hades is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see
+**[LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later](GPL-3.0-or-later)**.
 
 This file provides a description of how each source file should be annotated to make its license clear and unambiguous. **It doesn't replace Kodi's license**.
 
